{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/assistant/default-model.ts",
    "title": "测试用确定性助手模型",
    "summary": "为测试提供不执行推理的固定模型实现，仅展示运行时已经检索出的证据；生产装配不得用它替代真实 ACP 模型。",
    "category": "tests",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "scope",
        "title": "用途与生产边界",
        "body": "`DeterministicAssistantModel` 是 `AssistantModelPort` 的测试替身，不承担语义推理。文件明确要求生产环境注入真实 `AcpAssistantModel`；模型未配置时应由运行时诚实报告不可用，而不是悄悄改用固定答案。因此它只能证明运行时的确定性编排与引用链路，不能证明真实模型效果。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "behavior",
        "title": "固定输出行为",
        "body": "生成时最多取前五条已检索证据。没有证据便返回“当前材料中没有直接相关内容”且不附引用；有证据时按顺序展示标题和文本前缀，并把对应 fragment id 全部作为引用。若存在历史轮次，只追加轮次延续提示，不分析其内容。[[c2]] 这种行为便于测试断言稳定输出，但不应被解读为检索质量、回答正确性或外部 ACP 可用性的验收结果。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "测试替身边界",
        "reason": "支持该实现仅供测试、生产必须使用真实 ACP 且不可伪造兜底回答的结论。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/assistant/default-model.ts",
          "startLine": 7,
          "endLine": 15
        },
        "quote": "/**\n * Deterministic stand-in for the real LLM composer. It performs no inference:\n * it surfaces the evidence the runtime already retrieved and cites fragments.\n *\n * This exists ONLY for tests. Production assembly must inject the real\n * `AcpAssistantModel`; when no model is configured the runtime degrades honestly\n "
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "确定性回答生成",
        "reason": "支持无证据和有证据两种固定输出、五条上限、历史提示及 fragment 引用行为。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/assistant/default-model.ts",
          "startLine": 16,
          "endLine": 40
        },
        "quote": "  async generate(input: {\n    userText: string;\n    priorTurns: { ordinal: number; userText: string; result: string }[];\n    evidence: AssistantEvidence[];\n    visibility: \"private\" | \"group\";\n  }): Promise<AssistantModelReply> {\n    const evidence = input.evidence.slice(0, 5);\n    if (!evidence.length) {\n      return "
      }
